---
 import "../styles/global.css";
 import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
 import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>About us</title>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-black text-white text-center">
		<Navbar></Navbar>
		<h1 class="pt-8">Hi Visitor!!</h1>
		<br>
		<p>We are teens, brothers and a team, building and discovering new things in the world of Electronics!</p>
		<p>We are obsessed with Electronics and working on various projects in Hack Club.</p>
		<br>
		<br>
		<div>
			<div>
				<h1>Big Brother here!</h1>
				<br>
				<h3>Hey I am Keyaan!</h3>
				<br>
				<p>I am 18 Year old and a BE EC student. I am studying full time and working on Hack Club projects as a hobby in part time.</p>
				<p>My interest in Electronics got me to Hack Club through social media.</p>		
				<br>
				<p>I went to Hack Club hardware Hackathon <a class="Github" href="http://fallout.hackclub.com">Fallout</a> in Shenzen, China.</p>
				<br>
				<p>You can see my github <a class="Github" href="http://github.com/keyaan-07/">here</a></p>
				<p> I am also available on slack as <a class="Github" href="https://hackclub.enterprise.slack.com/team/U07DZ6A6CR4">@Keyaan</a></p>
			</div>
			<br>
			<div>
				<h1>Little Brother</h1>
				<br>
				<h3>Hello I am Ahad!</h3>
				<br>

				<p>I am 13 years old and studying in 7th grade. I got my interest in electronics through my big brother.</p>
				<p>He is my mentor, my go to person whereever and whenever i am stuck in the electronics projects.</p>

				<br>
				<p>I am eagerly waiting to board a plane for any of the Hackathon anywhere in the world. Which is yet to be approved by my parents.</p>

				<br>

				<p>You can see my github <a class="Github" href="http://github.com/ahad732/">here</a></p>
				<p class="pb-16">I am also available on slack as <a class="Github" href="https://hackclub.enterprise.slack.com/team/U0908H0TN9K">@Ahad</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<Footer></Footer>
</body>
</html>
